---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Membership: Club & Athletics NI Number - Omagh Harriers AC"
    description="Membership & ANI Guidelines"
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-black to-gray-900 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a
            href="/policies"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-amber hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors mb-4"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Policies
        </a>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Membership: Club & Athletics NI Number</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
        Membership & ANI Guidelines
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <!-- Membership Renewal -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Membership Renewal</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Due Date: January 1st annually.</li>
            <li>Grace Period:&nbsp;<strong>Membership must be renewed by January 31st</strong>.</li>
            <li>Communication Access:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members gain access to the club Runners and Info-Only WhatsApp groups.</li>
                <li>Members who have not renewed by January 31st will be removed from all club communication forums.
                </li>
                <li>New members that join during the year will be added to the communication channels within 7 days of
                  registering and payment received.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Membership Benefits -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Membership Benefits</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Two in-person coached sessions per week.</li>
            <li>Weekly training plans.</li>
            <li>Group speed &amp; recovery mile sessions.</li>
            <li>Subsidised kit.</li>
            <li>Subsidised social events.</li>
            <li>Subsidised track.</li>
          </ul>

          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 mt-6">Autumn Membership:</h4>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Discounted rates available from September 1st for new joiners.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Athletics NI Registration -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Athletics NI Registration (Optional)</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>The club subsidises the ANI fee. The subsidy will be set by the committee on an annual basis, once
              Athletics
              NI issues the yearly rate.
            </li>
            <li><strong>Senior Athletes</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Senior members contribute towards the cost of their Athletics NI (ANI) registration.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Junior Athletes</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>The club covers the full cost of ANI registration for junior members.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Criteria for Membership -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Criteria for Membership</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>Exclusive Club Affiliation</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members must be affiliated solely with Omagh Harriers A.C.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Commitment to Training and Events</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members should actively participate in training sessions and represent the club in competitions and
                  activities.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Adherence to Club Policies</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members must follow the club&rsquo;s rules and code of conduct, fostering a respectful and positive
                  environment.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Participation in Club Activities</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members are encouraged to contribute to the club&rsquo;s community through volunteering or
                  supporting
                  club-organized events.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Timely Payment of Membership Fees</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members must ensure their fees are paid promptly to maintain active membership.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Membership Trial -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Membership Trial</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Potential new members can avail of a maximum of three sessions in a 30-day period, paying &pound;2.00
              per
              session (or the prevailing rate the same as members). On or before the third session, the potential new
              member
              must decide if they wish to join the Club via Klubfunder.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Approval -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3"><strong>Approved by</strong>: Omagh Harriers A.C.
            Committee<br/><strong>Date</strong>: December 2024</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Logo -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center">
          <img src="/omagh-harriers_black.png" alt="Omagh Harriers AC Logo" width="408" height="160" class="mx-auto" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
